    "knowledge_point": "Computing the Limit at Infinity of a General Polynomial",
    "problem": "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }(-{x}^{4}+3).$",
    "worked_solution": "We identify the leading term and compute its limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }(-{x}^{4}+3) & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }(-{x}^{4}) \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }({x}^{4}) \\\\  & =-\\,(\\infty ) \\\\  & =-\\infty \\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
